-- Umber — an earth palette.
-- Generated by umber/neovim.py — do not edit by hand.
-- Syntax accents come from umber/editor.py: chroma is level across
-- keywords, functions, types, strings and literals, so hue separates
-- them and no role is muted relative to another.

